{"id":"2995f1052910e064","group":"29","path":"29/29-thm-trakhtenbrot.md","title":"内部有限可满足性归约定理","display":"thm-trakhtenbrot — 内部有限可满足性归约定理","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)","book_abbrev":"29","label":"29-thm-trakhtenbrot","aliases":["29-thm-trakhtenbrot"],"display":"thm-trakhtenbrot — 内部有限可满足性归约定理","depends_on":["[[29-df-relational-vocab]]","[[29-df-struc]]","[[29-df-truth]]","[[29-df-godel-numbering]]","[[29-df-computability]]","[[29-df-satisfaction]]"],"source_basis":"仅据所提供的第29本书文本重建缺失接口；不声称恢复缺失外部原文或完成机器证明","revision_basis":"本次仅据用户提供的29(1).zip修订；既有原书定位及过往核对叙述为继承记录，未重新取得或查看DjVu原件","revision_verification":"数学类型与接口审查、静态结构及链接检查；未提交证明助理内核证书"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"29"},{"key":"label","html":"29-thm-trakhtenbrot"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>29-thm-trakhtenbrot</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-trakhtenbrot — 内部有限可满足性归约定理"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"44836019093a45c6\" href=\"?note=44836019093a45c6\" title=\"29-df-relational-vocab\">29-df-relational-vocab</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4de8e0c8085801f5\" href=\"?note=4de8e0c8085801f5\" title=\"29-df-struc\">29-df-struc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"754d9a003ca52ced\" href=\"?note=754d9a003ca52ced\" title=\"29-df-truth\">29-df-truth</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a7fafe8aaa1edd6c\" href=\"?note=a7fafe8aaa1edd6c\" title=\"29-df-godel-numbering\">29-df-godel-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"a1f1e7424c0c2277\" href=\"?note=a1f1e7424c0c2277\" title=\"29-df-computability\">29-df-computability</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"3ee556c64b16809b\" href=\"?note=3ee556c64b16809b\" title=\"29-df-satisfaction\">29-df-satisfaction</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_basis","html":"仅据所提供的第29本书文本重建缺失接口；不声称恢复缺失外部原文或完成机器证明"},{"key":"revision_basis","html":"本次仅据用户提供的29(1).zip修订；既有原书定位及过往核对叙述为继承记录，未重新取得或查看DjVu原件"},{"key":"revision_verification","html":"数学类型与接口审查、静态结构及链接检查；未提交证明助理内核证书"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\\in\\mathrm{RelationalVocab}\">\\(\\tau\\in\\mathrm{RelationalVocab}\\)</span> 为有限关系词汇，可含常量；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists R\\in\\operatorname{Rel}(\\tau)\\;\\operatorname{ar}(R)\\geq2\">\\(\\exists R\\in\\operatorname{Rel}(\\tau)\\;\\operatorname{ar}(R)\\geq2\\)</span>。所有有限模型非空，语义取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"3ee556c64b16809b\" href=\"?note=3ee556c64b16809b\" title=\"29-df-satisfaction\">29-df-satisfaction</a> 和 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"754d9a003ca52ced\" href=\"?note=754d9a003ca52ced\" title=\"29-df-truth\">29-df-truth</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\\in\\operatorname{GNum}(\\tau)\">\\(g\\in\\operatorname{GNum}(\\tau)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RE},\\mathrm{Tot}_1,\\leq_m,\\mathrm{REComplete}_{\\leq_m}\">\\(\\mathrm{RE},\\mathrm{Tot}_1,\\leq_m,\\mathrm{REComplete}_{\\leq_m}\\)</span> 均取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"a1f1e7424c0c2277\" href=\"?note=a1f1e7424c0c2277\" title=\"29-df-computability\">29-df-computability</a> 的自然数编码接口。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FS}_\\tau(g),\\operatorname{FV}_\\tau(g)\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(\\operatorname{FS}_\\tau(g),\\operatorname{FV}_\\tau(g)\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span> 在下面定义；不合法代码不属于其中任一个集合。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FS}_\\tau(g)\\coloneqq\\{g(\\varphi)\\mid\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_\\tau\\land\\exists A\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\\;A\\models\\varphi\\},\\qquad\\operatorname{FV}_\\tau(g)\\coloneqq\\{g(\\varphi)\\mid\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_\\tau\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\\;A\\models\\varphi\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FS}_\\tau(g)\\coloneqq\\{g(\\varphi)\\mid\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_\\tau\\land\\exists A\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\\;A\\models\\varphi\\},\\qquad\\operatorname{FV}_\\tau(g)\\coloneqq\\{g(\\varphi)\\mid\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_\\tau\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\\;A\\models\\varphi\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FS}_\\tau(g)\\in\\mathrm{RE}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FS}_\\tau(g)\\in\\mathrm{RE}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall L\\in\\mathrm{RE}\\;\\exists f\\in\\mathrm{Tot}_1\\;\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\left(f(n)\\in g[\\mathrm{Sent}_\\tau]\\land(n\\in L\\leftrightarrow f(n)\\in\\operatorname{FS}_\\tau(g))\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall L\\in\\mathrm{RE}\\;\\exists f\\in\\mathrm{Tot}_1\\;\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\left(f(n)\\in g[\\mathrm{Sent}_\\tau]\\land(n\\in L\\leftrightarrow f(n)\\in\\operatorname{FS}_\\tau(g))\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FS}_\\tau(g)\\in\\mathrm{REComplete}_{\\leq_m},\\qquad\\operatorname{FV}_\\tau(g)\\notin\\mathrm{RE}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FS}_\\tau(g)\\in\\mathrm{REComplete}_{\\leq_m},\\qquad\\operatorname{FV}_\\tau(g)\\notin\\mathrm{RE}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>此条补齐原外部 Trakhtenbrot 悬空目标实际需要的有限可满足性内容，并把 RE 完全性所需的全可计算多一归约量词写出。可枚举性由枚举有限标号结构与有效句法、逐模型求值取得；有限有效性结论是关于合法句子代码，不把其直接写成整个自然数域上有限可满足集的补集。</p>\n<p>来源核对使用原条目的有限模型语境，以及 D. Kirst、D. Larchey-Wendling，Trakhtenbrot’s Theorem in Coq: Finite Model Theory through the Constructive Lens，2021，arXiv:2104.14445（至少二元关系及多一归约链）；R. Jaakkola，An Extension of Trakhtenbrot’s Theorem，2021，arXiv:2112.14996（RE 完全性陈述）。这些是书目说明，不是运行时或文档依赖。没有声称本文 Markdown 已被 Coq 核验，也未声称取得缺失的第57本书原文件。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"29-df-relational-vocab","status":"resolved","id":"44836019093a45c6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-relational-vocab]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-struc","status":"resolved","id":"4de8e0c8085801f5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-struc]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-truth","status":"resolved","id":"754d9a003ca52ced","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-truth]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-godel-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"a7fafe8aaa1edd6c","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-godel-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-computability","status":"resolved","id":"a1f1e7424c0c2277","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-computability]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"3ee556c64b16809b","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-satisfaction]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"3ee556c64b16809b","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\tau\\in\\mathrm{RelationalVocab}$ 为有限关系词汇，可含常量；$\\exists R\\in\\operatorname{Rel}(\\tau)\\;\\operatorname{ar}(R)\\geq2$。所有有限模型非空，语义取 [[29-df-satisfaction]] 和 [[29-df-truth]]。","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-truth","status":"resolved","id":"754d9a003ca52ced","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\tau\\in\\mathrm{RelationalVocab}$ 为有限关系词汇，可含常量；$\\exists R\\in\\operatorname{Rel}(\\tau)\\;\\operatorname{ar}(R)\\geq2$。所有有限模型非空，语义取 [[29-df-satisfaction]] 和 [[29-df-truth]]。","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-computability","status":"resolved","id":"a1f1e7424c0c2277","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$g\\in\\operatorname{GNum}(\\tau)$；$\\mathrm{RE},\\mathrm{Tot}_1,\\leq_m,\\mathrm{REComplete}_{\\leq_m}$ 均取 [[29-df-computability]] 的自然数编码接口。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\tau\\in\\mathrm{RelationalVocab}","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists R\\in\\operatorname{Rel}(\\tau)\\;\\operatorname{ar}(R)\\geq2","display":false},{"tex":"g\\in\\operatorname{GNum}(\\tau)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RE},\\mathrm{Tot}_1,\\leq_m,\\mathrm{REComplete}_{\\leq_m}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FS}_\\tau(g),\\operatorname{FV}_\\tau(g)\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FS}_\\tau(g)\\coloneqq\\{g(\\varphi)\\mid\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_\\tau\\land\\exists A\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\\;A\\models\\varphi\\},\\qquad\\operatorname{FV}_\\tau(g)\\coloneqq\\{g(\\varphi)\\mid\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_\\tau\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\\;A\\models\\varphi\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FS}_\\tau(g)\\in\\mathrm{RE}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall L\\in\\mathrm{RE}\\;\\exists f\\in\\mathrm{Tot}_1\\;\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\left(f(n)\\in g[\\mathrm{Sent}_\\tau]\\land(n\\in L\\leftrightarrow f(n)\\in\\operatorname{FS}_\\tau(g))\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FS}_\\tau(g)\\in\\mathrm{REComplete}_{\\leq_m},\\qquad\\operatorname{FV}_\\tau(g)\\notin\\mathrm{RE}.","display":true}],"bytes":2919,"backlinks":[{"id":"38909ffa6d1e85ce","anchor":"ref-186","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[29-thm-completeness]]、[[29-thm-compactness]]、[[29-thm-trakhtenbrot]] — 仅承接原缺失外部目标所需的定理陈述。"},{"id":"5055a09842f5520b","anchor":"ref-13","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"内部支持条目为 [[29-thm-trakhtenbrot]]；该条显式陈述所有 RE 集合向有限可满足代码集的全可计算多一归约，不能只用不可判定性替代完全性前提。"},{"id":"ecc0dd131d213345","anchor":"ref-232","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../29-thm-trakhtenbrot]]"}],"outgoing":["44836019093a45c6","4de8e0c8085801f5","754d9a003ca52ced","a7fafe8aaa1edd6c","a1f1e7424c0c2277","3ee556c64b16809b"]}